Aim: Write text to a file and read it.

Algorithm: Start
write using FileWriter
read using FileReader
display
stop.

Program:

import java.io.*;
class FileDemo {
    public static void main(String[] args) throws IOException {
        FileWriter w=new FileWriter("sample.txt");
        w.write("Hello File"); w.close();
        FileReader r=new FileReader("sample.txt");
        int ch;
        while((ch=r.read())!=-1) System.out.print((char)ch);
        r.close();
    }
}

Result: Hello File (also creates sample.txt)
